I ran into this issue, and was able to work around it by cloning the pages prior to importing, as seen in _PDFMergeUtility.java_.  

PDPage newPage = new PDPage( (COSDictionary)cloner.cloneForNewDocument( page.getCOSDictionary() ) );
newPage.setCropBox( page.findCropBox() );
newPage.setMediaBox( page.findMediaBox() );
newPage.setRotation( page.findRotation() );

This solution will still conserve pdf size (unlike the PDFMergeUtility), as well as avoid complications from the scratchFile issue described above.

